      "content": "I'm reviewing the final draft for the CardioFlow patent application. We're aiming to submit this by Friday to hit the Q3 filing window. \n\nCan you give me a high-level summary of the safety profile based on the latest internal lab and clinical reports? Specifically, I need to know if there are any unforeseen safety signals or adverse event trends that might trigger intense regulatory scrutiny or, more importantly, cause a delay in our filing process. We need this to be as clean as possible for the USPTO.",
